{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、キューポットカフェにいってきました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3ASSB9P0WGB8J5Q9KEDZ9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nうさぎのブルーベリーラテ (・x・)\nと\nリアルなチーズケーキ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3AV7EJRSMQA8F6FHPBQZH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nすごいかわいいお皿!\nネックレスとブレスレットも生クリームで食べれます(*ˊᗜˋ*)/♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店内も好き〜。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3AX5N6PC39800MPX65HVH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n高校の時のお友達と。\n茶道部で一緒でした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜にチキンを食べました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3AYNB8T6R6THF1ZBNMXPF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n甘辛〜。\nヤンニョムチキンです!\nとってもおいしいので食べてみてしいです。\nとっても量が多いです〜。お友達と行くといいかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにプリクラを撮りました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3B0K30YGVV74ZH3BSM49S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3B25FA21VVA6EF97GS95N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n越智ゆらのちゃんと林田真尋ちゃんのプリクラを参考に撮りました。\nプリクラの落書きが苦手なので、とても助かりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆらまひちゃん、とっても好きです!\n私とお友達の癒しです❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜は、ココアを飲みながらLARMEを読んで寝ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}